(cherry picked from commit 91a2334cbf479f688cc421aa7f7eb1802e8e2bfb)

Backport adaptation for 148: this branch has the icon-theme sanitize
merge but not the later GtkSettings set_property interceptor framework
(ThemeProperty/IsValidThemeName/InstallGtkSettingsInterceptor) or
gtk_util_unittest.cc, so the write-time interceptor parts are omitted.
GtkUi::SanitizeCursorThemeName/Size are implemented against the
existing SanitizeIconThemeName pattern using the new
ui::IsValidCursorThemeName/Size helpers; load-time validation in
x11_cursor_loader and wayland_cursor_factory applies as upstream.

